    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00618",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“那还是很久以前的事……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That was still something from long ago...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00618",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "全家人一齐趁夜晚逃出……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The whole family all slipped away together during the night...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00618",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不久，成了空屋子，真危险，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Before long, it became an empty house, and that was truly dangerous,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00618",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "差一点无法弥补……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It almost became impossible to put right...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00618",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "真的很危险哟……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It really was dangerous, you know...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00618",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "只要哪里有一处倒坍，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If even one place anywhere collapsed,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00618",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "那以后就像大坝出现裂痕一样……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "after that it would be just like a crack appearing in a dam...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
